OL,3,GNEWSABattle of bands brings islands'
OL,4,Arivalry to stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung musicians from Jersey and
OL,7,FGuernsey will go head-to-head on
OL,8,FSaturday in a new inter-island battle
OL,9,Fof the bands competition inspired by
OL,10,Fthe Muratti football rivalry.
OL,12,FMusic Muratti, launched by the School
OL,13,Fof Popular Music, will allow under-18
OL,14,Fbands to represent their island in a
OL,15,Fcontest at Beau Sejour Theatre in
OL,16,FGuernsey.
OL,18,FSix bands, Fridge Magnet, Last Hope and
OL,19,FShockwave from Guernsey and Ctrl-3,
OL,20,FLupus and The Fadeaways from Jersey,
OL,21,Fwill be lining up for the contest in
OL,22,Ffront of music industry judges.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
